{"term":{"label":"德","occurrences":2,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"5B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii","title":"萬章下","description":"孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"乘","id":"乘"},{"form":"事","id":"事"},{"form":"云","id":"云"},{"form":"五","id":"五"},{"form":"使","id":"使"},{"form":"友","id":"友"},{"form":"善","id":"善"},{"form":"地","id":"地"},{"form":"天","id":"天"},{"form":"子","id":"子"},{"form":"德","id":"德"},{"form":"斯","id":"斯"},{"form":"聖","id":"聖"},{"form":"視","id":"視"},{"form":"道","id":"道"},{"form":"里","id":"里"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.4423470353692043,"source":"聖","target":"事"},{"weight":1.1895840668738364,"source":"使","target":"事"},{"weight":0.9272198024063453,"source":"使","target":"子"},{"weight":2.03688192726104,"source":"云","target":"事"},{"weight":1.7004096906398272,"source":"云","target":"友"},{"weight":1.3437347467010947,"source":"斯","target":"天"},{"weight":1.8181927262962105,"source":"斯","target":"友"},{"weight":2.847812143477369,"source":"斯","target":"善"},{"weight":3.2044870874161013,"source":"視","target":"地"},{"weight":1.3437347467010947,"source":"視","target":"天"},{"weight":2.1799827709017134,"source":"視","target":"子"},{"weight":2.1058747987479913,"source":"德","target":"友"},{"weight":2.4423470353692043,"source":"德","target":"事"},{"weight":2.1799827709017134,"source":"德","target":"子"},{"weight":1.8827312474337816,"source":"乘","target":"友"},{"weight":3.0867040517597175,"source":"里","target":"地"},{"weight":0.9382696385929302,"source":"里","target":"天"},{"weight":1.774517662793549,"source":"里","target":"子"},{"weight":1.9568392195875035,"source":"子","target":"天"},{"weight":2.025832091074455,"source":"子","target":"地"},{"weight":0.2340726218464,"source":"子","target":"友"},{"weight":1.2636920390275583,"source":"子","target":"事"},{"weight":2.03688192726104,"source":